  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing criteria for both the award and the jurors. 
Jurors chosen from different UN agencies
Award is granted and qualified applicants are identified and awarded</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Criteria of KHA and Judging Criteria are not in place</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Sign an extension to the project
- Put together a Judging panel representing at least 6 different UN Agencies, with at least 3 from UNDP. 
- Update the judging criteria and process in collaboration with IP 
- Support the awarding ceremony logistically and technically as much as the fund allowed. .</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Extension document to the project was signed. 
- A judging panel was put together, consisting of 9 jurors representing 7 UN entities (4 Females, and 5 Males), with 9 jurors representing 7 UN entities set on the initial panel (4 Females, and 5 Males), with the Bahrain CO&#x2019;s RR as one of the judging members. 
- Judging criteria and process were updated in collaboration with the IP. 
- Bahrain CO also engaged with UNDP and other UN agencies internationally to advocate and communicate about the King Hamad Award to young people around the world.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Produce a documentary film on the award 
- Enhance the Awards portal
- Update the judging criteria and process in collaboration with IP</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	Judging criteria is completed and will be finalized by end of July 2021
-	Elements of enhancement of the Award&#x2019;s portal is agreed on by both UNDP and MYS.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support management of the Awards 4th version</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Awards 4th version launched and award event physically held in Bahrain.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
